:"தீ","parts":[{"text":"தீ","lemma":"தீ","gloss":"sweet"}],"gloss":"sweet"},{"surface":"நீர்","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"water"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கோல்","parts":[{"text":"கோல்","lemma":"கோல்","gloss":"beauty"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"அமை","parts":[{"text":"அமை","lemma":"அமை","gloss":"fashioned"}],"gloss":"fashioned"},{"surface":"குறும்","parts":[{"text":"குறும்","lemma":"குறு","gloss":"small"}],"gloss":"small"},{"surface":"தொடி","parts":[{"text":"தொடி","lemma":"தொடி","gloss":"bracelet"}],"gloss":"bracelets"},{"surface":"குறுமகள்","parts":[{"text":"குறுமகள்","lemma":"குறுமகள்","gloss":"young woman"}],"gloss":"young woman"},{"surface":"ஒழிய","parts":[{"text":"ஒழிய","lemma":"ஒழி","gloss":"leave behind"}],"gloss":"leaving behind"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆள்வினை","parts":[{"text":"ஆள்வினை","lemma":"ஆள்வினை","gloss":"effort"}],"gloss":"effort"},{"surface":"மருங்கின்","parts":[{"text":"மருங்கு","lemma":"மருங்கு","gloss":"side"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"locative suffix"}],"gloss":"towards"},{"surface":"பிரியார்","parts":[{"text":"பிரி","lemma":"பிரி","gloss":"part"},{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"they will not (negative third person plural)"}],"gloss":"they will not part"},{"surface":"நாளும்","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"every"}],"gloss":"daily"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உறன்முறை","parts":[{"text":"உறன்முறை","lemma":"உறன்முறை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மரபிற்","parts":[{"text":"மரபிற்","lemma":"மரபிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கூற்றத்","parts":[{"text":"கூற்றத்","lemma":"கூற்றத்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தறனில்","parts":[{"text":"தறனில்","lemma":"தறனில்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கோணற்","parts":[{"text":"கோணற்","lemma":"கோணற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கறிந்திசி","parts":[{"text":"கறிந்திசி","lemma":"கறிந்திசி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"னோரே","parts":[{"text":"னோரே","lemma":"னோரே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Vast-place world's accumulated-yield great-wealth / all-together-with if-obtained, sugarcane's / stalk-cut piece's node-eaten-like / white-teeth-secreted fault-less sweet-water [of] / beauty-fashioned small-bracelets young-woman leaving-behind, / effort's side they-will-not-part, daily / relationship-manner custom's Death's / virtue-less crookedness having-known-they.","translation":"Even if the great wealth of the vast world's accumulated yields were to be obtained all at once, those who truly know the virtue-less, crooked ways of Death, who comes daily in accordance with his custom, would never leave behind the young woman of beautiful, small bracelets, to go in search of wealth, parting from her sweet, faultless saliva that tastes like eating the sweet node of a cut piece of sugarcane.","modern":"பரந்த இடத்தைக் கொண்ட உலகத்தின் திரண்ட பயனாகிய பெருஞ்செல்வம் முழுவதும் ஒருசேரக் கிடைப்பதாக இருந்தாலும், கரும்பின் தண்டை வெட்டிய துண்டின் கணுவைச் சுவைப்பது போன்ற, வெண்மையான பற்களிலிருந்து ஊறும் குற்றமற்ற இனிய நீரினையும், அழகிய சிறிய வளையல்களையும் உடைய இளமகளைப் பிரிந்து, முயற்சி மேற்கொண்டு செல்ல மாட்டார்கள்; நாள்தோறும் முறைப்படி உயிரைக் கவரும் கூற்றுவனின் அறமற்ற கோணல் வழியை அறிந்தவர்கள்.","explanation":"The hero speaks to himself when contemplating leaving his beloved to earn wealth. He realizes that life is fleeting and Death is relentless and unjust, taking lives daily without any moral regard. Knowing this inevitable end, he decides that even the greatest wealth of the entire world is not worth parting from his beloved. Her sweet saliva is as delicious as the juice from a sugarcane node, and her presence is far more valuable than material gain. This poem belongs to the pālai tiṇai, where the theme of parting for wealth is contrasted with the stark reality of mortality.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.87],[0.87,1.4],[1.4,1.9],[1.9,2.8],[2.8,3.2],[3.2,3.8],[3.8,4.3],[4.3,4.83],[4.83,5.41],[5.41,6.13],[6.13,6.56],[6.56,6.99],[6.99,7.43],[7.43,8.0],[8.0,8.58],[8.58,8.96],[8.96,9.34],[9.34,9.77],[9.77,10.1],[10.1,10.59],[10.59,11.2],[11.2,12.1],[12.1,12.4],[12.7,13.1],[13.1,13.5],[13.5,13.7],[13.7,14.68],[14.68,14.85],[15.01,15.17],[15.17,16.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,2.0],[2.0,3.2],[3.2,3.6],[3.6,4.4],[4.4,4.9],[4.9,6.0],[6.0,6.59],[6.59,7.06],[7.06,7.3],[7.3,7.85],[7.85,8.12],[8.12,9.5],[9.5,10.47],[10.47,10.85],[10.85,11.61],[11.61,12.12],[12.12,12.5],[12.5,13.03],[13.03,13.7],[13.7,14.5],[14.5,14.9],[15.6,15.9],[15.9,16.3],[16.3,16.5],[16.5,17.59],[17.59,17.77],[17.95,18.14],[18.14,19.1]]},"sync":[[["இருங்கண்","vast place"]],[["ஞாலத்து","of the world"]],[["ஞாலத்து","of the world"],["ஈண்டு","accumulated"],["பய","yield"]],[["பெரு","great"],["வளம்","wealth"]],[["ஒருங்குடன்","all together"]],[["இயைவது","that which is obtained"]],[["இயைவது","that which is obtained"],["ஆயினும்","even if it is"]],[["கரும்பின்","of sugarcane"]],[["கால்","stalk"],["எறி","cut"]],[["கடிகை","piece"],["கண்","node"]],[["கண்","node"],["அயின்று","having eaten"]],[["அயின்று","having eaten"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["வால்","white"],["எயிறு","teeth"]],[["எயிறு","teeth"],["ஊறிய","secreted"]],[["வசை","fault"],["இல்","without"]],[["தீ","sweet"],["நீர்","water"]],[["கோல்","beautiful"],["அமை","fashioned"]],[["குறும்","small"],["தொடி","bracelets"]],[["குறுமகள்","young woman"]],[["குறுமகள்","young woman"],["ஒழிய","leaving behind"]],[["ஆள்வினை","effort"]],[["மருங்கின்","towards"]],[["பிரியார்","they will not part"]],[["நாளும்","daily"]],[["உறன்முறை",""]],[["மரபிற்",""]],[["கூற்றத்",""]],[["தறனில்",""]],[["கோணற்",""]],[["கறிந்திசி",""]],[["னோரே",""]]]}